# One line ending everywhere. A table is developed on Linux, on macOS and on Windows, and the
# exported models, the clips and the pages are the same bytes on all three: a checkout with the
# line endings of Windows in it would change the fingerprint of a file and fail a test which
# reads the first line of one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# What is not text and is never to be touched.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.wasm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff2 binary
